WEBVTT

00:14:25.378 --> 00:14:30.378
If we do, we will find that the collective voices

00:14:30.378 --> 00:14:34.768
of the poor will be heard in Bihar,

00:14:34.768 --> 00:14:36.990
in Uganda, and beyond.

00:14:36.990 --> 00:14:41.065
We will find that textbooks and teachers

00:14:41.065 --> 00:14:44.102
will show up in schools for their children.

00:14:44.102 --> 00:14:48.185
We will find that these children, too,

00:14:48.185 --> 00:14:54.303
have a real chance of breaking their way out of poverty.

00:14:54.303 --> 00:14:57.518
Thank you. (Applause)

00:14:57.518 --> 00:15:00.238
(Applause)